# Archived chain responses: large, growing daily, and belonging in object
# storage rather than git -- see docs/archive.md.
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: an unanchored `archive/` would also
# match `src/archive/`, which is the archiver's source code.
/archive/

# Written by scripts/setup-r2-archive.sh: R2 credentials for syncing the
# archive by hand. Never commit these.
.env

# Generated from the archive by scripts/build-ui-fixture.ts, and inlined into
# prototype/basket.html at publish time. Rebuildable, so not tracked.
prototype/fixture.json
